# Dashboard design

Before changing a dashboard, read `docs/design/enterprise-saas.md` and `docs/design/fintech-dashboard.md`. The pointer is `docs/design/README.md`.

- Layout, type, cards, tables, and status follow Enterprise SaaS.
- Scores, counts, SLA days, and money follow Fintech: `tabular-nums`, right-aligned, sign plus color, never truncated.
- Use the `.dash` tokens in `grc-frontend/styles/dashboard.css`. Do not invent a second palette.
- Cards use a border, not a resting shadow. One primary action per section.
